        <title type="html"><![CDATA[ci(pr-check-lint_content): refine workflow]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43073</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43073"/>
        <updated>2026-02-11T10:53:42.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/495429?u=2f3b9dd03c6c4a961d44a632fe1976c73fa19e1f&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/>

<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Refines the <code class="notranslate">pr-check-lint_content</code>:</p>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>Move only Markdown files, ignoring any non-Markdown files.</li>
<li>Run the workflow on <code class="notranslate">pull_request</code> if the workflow itself gets changed.</li>
<li>Lint Markdown files in the root directory.</li>
<li>Separate tools into different steps, with diff after each step.</li>
</ol>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>Avoid unintended side-effects of non-Markdown files on linting tools.</li>
<li>Ensure workflow regressions are noticed before merging changes to it.</li>
<li>Ensure workflow runs properly on PRs that only touch root Markdown files.</li>
<li>Make it easier to identify which tool introduced a change.</li>
</ol>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">See <a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/actions/runs/21840361319/job/63022712540?pr=43073">this test run</a> with example changes (<a class="commit-link" data-hovercard-type="commit" data-hovercard-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/92ef06c54d72a85211e3ad07085141969ef361ce/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/92ef06c54d72a85211e3ad07085141969ef361ce"><tt>92ef06c</tt></a>).</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>



]]></content>
