<p dir="auto">Add documentation for the new <code class="notranslate">runtime.getVersion()</code> method, supported on Chrome 143+[1], Safari 26.2[2][3]. Firefox does not support it yet[4]. Cross-link with other files. Update related sections in other documents.</p>
